        "- [汉字＋词根Ruby (6.39 MB)](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/montainternoadorihistorion/esperanto-radiko-cjk-annotator-revision-20261017/fe1e11218f125218189d1dea6e45e7afbf4cb15e/assignment_editions/legacy/ZH/kanji.json.gz)",
